e","shared_categories":"American (New), American (Traditional), Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"7JiyUwszN600WC1JWSlcTA","review_id":"NCQQa9gag6F5UfJvwu2rfA","date":"2014-10-30T23:47:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.948810875415802,"text_excerpt":"That Borche burger had me falling more and more in love with each bite. Every component of it blended just perfectly together. I got mine with bacon and a fried egg on top per the dude that took my order's suggestion, I'm glad I listened. The staff all seem like a bunch of cool kids, like fun to be around. There's only one television inside the bar area but it's viewable to more of the tables than not. I like that i can still get my favorite dogs from Dat Dog with the same toppings, but the adding of burgers to the line up was a power move on their part. I think it's safe to say Dis and Dat has snagged my attention for when I'm in the mood for a burger in Mid City. Not to say I can't get ..."},{"business_id":"7JiyUwszN600WC1JWSlcTA","review_id":"bw8ElJS2MS8iHJEsPsZ6cw","date":"2014-10-05T13:22:51","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9368714094161987,"text_excerpt":"BLUF: I'll be back to have some beers and another burger or dog. Shotgun style house turned restaurant. Seating outside in front. Seating outside in the back. Long bar to eat at and some inside tables. Classic Dat Dog atmosphere (loud colorful signs and puns). Order at the bar and they'll bring your food. They are pretty quick and pretty friendly. Sitting out front is nice to experience the neighborhood. (I bet once the VA hospital is up and running Dis and Dat is going to make a ton of money) I was dying of hunger so i ordered the burger that has a sausage on it. It was really really good. They are not homemade patties (at least they dont look like they are, appear frozen when the put it..."},{"business_id":"7JiyUwszN600WC1JWSlcTA","review_id":"poAtgz-ULfjT7qFirHlCJg","date":"2015-01-01T01:26:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9367650747299194,"text_excerpt":"Overall I enjoyed this place very much. I've gone three times now with people who wanted to try it out and everyone was satisfied. The burgers are very tasty due to the sauce they use as a glaze. I especially liked the sweet doughy bun. My only issues are the lack of burger options, no sides and the price"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"7JiyUwszN600WC1JWSlcTA","photo_id":"uW8ucRySEluz2UGRcL_NMA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/uW8ucRySEluz2UGRcL_NMA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9218995571136475},{"business_id":"7JiyUwszN600WC1JWSlcTA","photo_id":"TRg9p7_Qb-xmIDkvYxnUaw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/TRg9p7_Qb-xmIDkvYxnUaw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.880020022392273},{"business_id":"7JiyUwszN600WC1JWSlcTA","photo_id":"ogqT6U_P7wbsNySrGNTErg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ogqT6U_P7wbsNySrGNTErg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8430590629577637}]},"notebook_case":n